# Copy to .env and fill in — never commit the real .env file.
# Only needed once generation (LLM inference) is run for real; ingestion/retrieval work without this.
#
# Decision (PRD.md Section 8, item #6): Anthropic API (Claude Haiku), not Groq/Gemini as
# originally considered — this build sandbox can only reach api.anthropic.com, not the other
# providers' endpoints, so this is the one choice that could be exercised end-to-end during
# development. See docs/SOLUTION_CRITIQUE.md Section 2 for the full reasoning.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
